  "stem": "<p style=\"text-align: left;\">The table shows selected values from function <math alttext=\"f\"><mi>f</mi>\n</math>.</p>\n<figure class=\"table\"><table border=\"1\">\n<tbody>\n<tr style=\"height: 22.3906px;\">\n<th style=\"width: 47.704%; text-align: center; height: 22.3906px;\" scope=\"col\"><math alttext=\"x\"><mi>x</mi>\n</math></th>\n<th style=\"width: 47.704%; text-align: center; height: 22.3906px;\" scope=\"col\"><math alttext=\"f left parenthesis x right parenthesis\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced></math></th>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 22.3906px;\">\n<td style=\"width: 47.704%; height: 22.3906px; text-align: center;\"><math alttext=\"negative 1\"><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn>\n</math></td>\n<td style=\"width: 47.704%; height: 22.3906px; text-align: center;\"><math alttext=\"16\"><mn>16</mn>\n</math></td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 22.3906px;\">\n<td style=\"width: 47.704%; height: 22.3906px; text-align: center;\"><math alttext=\"0\"><mn>0</mn>\n</math></td>\n<td style=\"width: 47.704%; height: 22.3906px; text-align: center;\"><math alttext=\"17\"><mn>17</mn>\n</math></td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 22.3906px;\">\n<td style=\"width: 47.704%; height: 22.3906px; text-align: center;\"><math alttext=\"1\"><mn>1</mn>\n</math></td>\n<td style=\"width: 47.704%; height: 22.3906px; text-align: center;\"><math alttext=\"18\"><mn>18</mn>\n</math></td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 22.3906px;\">\n<td style=\"width: 47.704%; height: 22.3906px; text-align: center;\"><math alttext=\"2\"><mn>2</mn>\n</math></td>\n<td style=\"width: 47.704%; height: 22.3906px; text-align: center;\"><math alttext=\"19\"><mn>19</mn>\n</math></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table></figure>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">Which of the following is the best description of function <math alttext=\"f\"><mi>f</mi>\n</math>?</p>",
